, predictable surface over a large, capable engine."}]}]]}]}],["$","$L14",null,{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"border-t border-border pt-8 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"label-mono flex items-center gap-3 text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent-blue","children":"03"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"h-px w-6 bg-border"}],"Intended users"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"People who live in a terminal and want media handling to be a one-liner, not a research project."}]}]]}]}],["$","$L14",null,{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"border-t border-border pt-8 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"label-mono flex items-center gap-3 text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent-blue","children":"04"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"h-px w-6 bg-border"}],"Key features"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider text-accent-blue","children":"01"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Link inspection with available formats and metadata"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider text-accent-blue","children":"02"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Quality and format selection with sensible defaults"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider text-accent-blue","children